Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(shepherd):=20reject=20--bundle=20+=20--pull?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20together=20=E2=80=94=20mutually=20exclusive=20output=20modes?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20(CodeRabbit=20#341)?=
